        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "\"MELTY BLOOD\" is a series of 2D fighting games based on TYPE-MOON's visual romance novel \"Tsukihime\". Since the game's original release on PC in 2002, it has also had a number of ports for arcade, PlayStation 2, and Steam.\nNow, at long last, the \"MELTY BLOOD\" series is making its way to PlayStation4, Nintendo Switch, Xbox One, and Steam on September 30, 2021 in the form of \"MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA\".",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "MELTY BLOOD es una serie de juegos de lucha 2D basada en la novela visual Tsukihime, de TYPE-MOON. Desde su lanzamiento original para PC en 2002, también ha tenido varias versiones para recreativas, PlayStation 2 y Steam.\nPor fin, la serie MELTY BLOOD llega a PlayStation 4, Nintendo Switch, Xbox One y Steam el 30 de septiembre de 2021 con el título MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2021",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
